<title>GERMANY: Villeroy takes charge on 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Villeroy takes charge on 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>METLACH, Germany 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net loss			     103     vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    33	vs 87.4</p>
<p>    Group restructuring charge	     114.1   vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,453   down 2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German tableware and bathroom fittings group is Villeroy &amp; Boch AG.</p>
<p>Villeroy has previously said it would not pay a dividend on its 1996 results. Its dividend payout in 1995 was 7.50 marks per preference share and 6.50 marks per ordinary share.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
